{"event_type":"review","id":"fb63ab9838d6130e30d1c0841ab71e98798141d73219f90d99a7b7ccf4d4efb4","occurred_at":"2026-11-05T18:45:40Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/09b8c4d9f7c84184d636818598735e32852d5eeae41364d6ba667edab6aa99e2","sha256":"09b8c4d9f7c84184d636818598735e32852d5eeae41364d6ba667edab6aa99e2"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/2765eb7e7cb9dc2e9aa77881961a6faf5544898d410bf496937e1b3096379cdd","sha256":"2765eb7e7cb9dc2e9aa77881961a6faf5544898d410bf496937e1b3096379cdd"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/92ba1caf0f7336bf6c92fe058c8cd6d60852f929e1435cd55b6e95edcbb747c6","sha256":"92ba1caf0f7336bf6c92fe058c8cd6d60852f929e1435cd55b6e95edcbb747c6"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e9a407468b7ce31bbf33a2f1b7d602a48928b3c1d86a93b7e726d3ee33d285db","sha256":"e9a407468b7ce31bbf33a2f1b7d602a48928b3c1d86a93b7e726d3ee33d285db"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/3ca007a3349e5f0c5f215f789c6fb681f2323f9546236341b6fb264957fb3eba","sha256":"3ca007a3349e5f0c5f215f789c6fb681f2323f9546236341b6fb264957fb3eba"}],"attempt_id":"ec8596f0bfff8ada05137884bf6e43437624183fb6900def253a8031d0cc1f39:0:1","base":"6fb5d2cbc646d7ab4bb5be0a3239bca9b4bc7e63","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"1d3488061636db3e3dedcc19995c731c25093279","body":"**Add `capabilityEvidence` to the strict-ceiling infrastructure-failure verdict.**\n\nThe verdict at `src/driver/ai-sdk/index.ts:1323-1335` omits `...capabilityEvidence`. Every other verdict produced after the probe includes it. Examples:\n- the abort path at 1300\n- the strict-ceiling `budget` path at 1318\n- the generic error path at 1354\n- the repair-path infrastructure refusal at 1810\n\nThe comment at 830-832 says the evidence goes on \"EVERY post-probe verdict\". The `WorkerResult.capabilities` contract in `src/driver/types.ts` makes the same claim. This omission causes a concrete failure. Suppose a capability, serialization, or durable-hook failure happens on a run where grep or glob was offered. The result then loses the `rg` probe record and the \"search tools unavailable\" advisory. Consumers cannot tell whether search was withheld on that run.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n         return {\n           usage: stepUsage,\n           usageProvenance: usageEvidence ? 'measured' : 'unmeasured',\n           steps: completedSteps,\n           sessionId: record.sessionId,\n           denials,\n+          ...capabilityEvidence,\n           stopReason: 'error',\n```\n</details>","id":"ad01bbe18865199c9239be94a6a9250377ff969e04431b341416f5127aa77f68","intervals":[],"path":"src/driver/ai-sdk/index.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Add `capabilityEvidence` to the strict-ceiling infrastructure-failure verdict."}],"head":"23abc8a35700a6cb6d79dfb190d30029a36c2d23","head_tree":"74119e2e60617e97b4070712a18195b8b48c1179","input_scope":[{"blob":"1d3488061636db3e3dedcc19995c731c25093279","intervals":[[11,19],[22,25],[28,48],[56,66],[72,77],[99,123],[142,143],[153,182],[188,208],[215,215],[218,220],[225,226],[228,238],[241,250],[253,267],[269,271],[277,278],[284,286],[290,330],[334,363],[373,380],[389,412],[422,422],[425,425],[428,436],[444,448],[450,463],[465,470],[473,484],[486,535],[540,558],[560,652],[656,660],[686,690],[692,759],[761,806],[808,956],[966,966],[969,981],[988,1013],[1016,1151],[1153,1154],[1164,1167],[1169,1218],[1221,1224],[1228,1235],[1239,1250],[1253,1260],[1262,1263],[1271,1282],[1285,1336],[1339,1340],[1345,1347],[1350,1351],[1354,1358],[1365,1897],[1899,1899],[1902,1905],[1909,1909],[1912,1912],[1919,1923],[1937,2004],[2010,2018],[2032,2062],[2064,2065],[2068,2073],[2077,2079],[2081,2081],[2083,2089],[2091,2